# الرازي لـ Raspberry Pi: الإبقاء فقط على البرمجيات الثابتة التي يحتاجها الجهاز ومحولات USB الشائعة
path-exclude=/usr/lib/firmware/*
path-include=/usr/lib/firmware/brcm/*
path-include=/usr/lib/firmware/cypress/*
path-include=/usr/lib/firmware/regulatory.db*
path-include=/usr/lib/firmware/rtlwifi/*
path-include=/usr/lib/firmware/rtl_nic/*
path-include=/usr/lib/firmware/rtl_bt/*
path-include=/usr/lib/firmware/rtw88/*
path-include=/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/*
path-include=/usr/lib/firmware/ath9k_htc/*
path-include=/usr/lib/firmware/rt2870.bin*
path-include=/usr/lib/firmware/mt7601u.bin*
path-include=/usr/lib/firmware/htc_*
# لغات محرك المتصفح: العربية والإنجليزية فقط
path-exclude=/usr/share/qt5/translations/qtwebengine_locales/*
path-include=/usr/share/qt5/translations/qtwebengine_locales/ar.pak
path-include=/usr/share/qt5/translations/qtwebengine_locales/en-US.pak
